,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6 RC2, 4.6 Beta 3, 4.6 Beta 2\n- Not Reproducible in: 4.6 Beta 1 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc2 - Pop!_OS 24.04 LTS on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (RADV NAVI31) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.23 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen launching any game in the run window, the window is spawned at a much smaller size than the specified viewport resolution project setting:\n\n<img width=\"330\" height=\"285\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c05f6e9-13d0-42c6-9fbf-5613e1f3bd56\" />\n\nI expect the window to look like this:\n\n<img width=\"1623\" height=\"971\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bb8a848-4761-44a7-8817-c5f589224335\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun any project in a Linux Wayland environment with the Editor Settings -> Run -> Platform -> Prefer Wayland checkbox enabled.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gith